---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const title = "Privacy";
---

<BaseLayout title={title}>
  <br />
  <br />
  <div class="justify-center mt-12">
    <h3 class="text-primary text-semibold">Privacy Policy</h3>
    <p class="mb-9">
      This website uses <a href="https://vercel.com/analytics" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vercel Analytics</a> to collect anonymous, aggregated
      usage data (such as page views and general visitor counts). This does
      not use tracking cookies and does not collect any personally
      identifiable information. I don't sell or share your data with anyone.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-9">
      The only user-submitted data this site stores is blog comments. If you
      post a comment, the comment text, an optional name (or "Anonymous" if
      you leave it blank), and the time it was posted are saved to a database
      so the comment can be displayed. Comments are held for manual review
      before they appear publicly.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-12">
      Aside from comments and anonymous analytics, this website is static and
      has no backend or database storing personal information.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-9">
      If you have any concerns, please contact me at <a href="mailto:nickstambaugh@proton.me">nickstambaugh@proton.me</a>. 
      You can view the source code for this website on <a href="https://github.com/sieep-coding/sieep-coding.github.io">https://github.com/sieep-coding/sieep-coding.github.io</a>. 
      This website is released under <a href="/license">The Unlicense</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>